                                                "sense_id": "b819e715-dd87-3915-8bf6-7550fc846156",
                                                "text": "I once found myself listening to a gay man who was saying wistfully, \"I wish there was someplace you could go, maybe a club, where only masculine men would be allowed in.\" […] Ever tactful, I did not point out to him that if such a place existed, he probably would not be allowed into it."
                                            }
